                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">At-Least-Once + Ack Leases</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                            Workers claim tasks with time-bounded leases. If a worker dies mid-job, the lease expires and the broker re-enqueues the unacknowledged message.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-3">
                        <div class="text-amber-400 text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-skull-crossbones"></i></div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Dead Letter Queue (DLQ)</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                            Payloads that trigger worker crashes repeatedly ($> 3$ attempts) are isolated into a DLQ to prevent continuous partition blocking.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-3">
                        <div class="text-brand-400 text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i></div>
